 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under START (8): Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die, Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Prepared Defenses, All Wrapped Up, No Bargain, Power Of The Hutt; these count toward the 60.",
  "The list shows a plain 'Boba Fett' among the characters, but the strategy says 'Scratch the Boba Fett, I accidently typed that in'; it is left out, which brings the list to 60 and matches the 'CHARACTERS(22)' header.",
  "Posted 'Fett w/ gun' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Fett (CC)' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City); 'Bossk w/ gun' dested Bossk With Mortar Gun; 'Dengar w/ gun' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'IG-88 w/ gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; '4-LOM w/ gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand (the only Dark Mara Jade of the era).",
  "Posted 'T Pit of Carkoon' dested Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon; 'T JP' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Boba iS1' / 'Bossk iHT' / 'Zuckuss iMH' dested Boba Fett In Slave I / Bossk In Hound's Tooth / Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
  "Posted 'Shut Him up OSHD' dested Shut Him Up Or Shut Him Down; 'NSP' dested None Shall Pass (the strategy spells it out); 'Oota Goota, Solo?' dested Oo-ta Goo-ta, Solo?.",
  "The 'STARSHIPS/VEHICLES(3)' section lists four cards, including the vehicle Jabba's Sail Barge."
